0 Leo's hair is MINI WIG NO. 63 (29066, Reddish Brown), which this LDraw
0 library does not draw. 18228 is the nearest real wig, so it stands in --
0 but no kit ships 18228 in Reddish Brown, and COLOUR vs KIT used to judge
0 the stand-in against its own kit colours. PROXY now redirects that check
0 to the real design id, which is exactly what the proxy means.
